Hello All,

We have a 12x8 HDPE Reducer that is molded as an alternative to the swage r=
educer version of this fitting.

Its part number is 66-31151208.

When you receive an order for the swage reducer version, part number 65-311=
51208, convert the order to the molded version 66-31151208.  We will not be=
 replenishing the swage reducer version for the time being.

The molded version will be lower priced.

Advise customer.

Price lists will be updated accordingly.

John

